expression: popup
---
  Agent Role Templates
  Create and inspect role profiles used by spawn_agent.agent_type.
  User templates live in $CODEX_HOME/agents/*.toml.
  Runtime tool catalog: 3 current-thread tools, 1 selected by current policy.

  1. Create new template                   Edit a native TOML role draft for future sub-agent spawns
  2. Create template from current model    Seed a native TOML role draft with current model defaults
› 3. Create template from current tools    Opens a searchable tool picker and then an editable native
                                           TOML draft. The current-thread catalog is used only as
                                           tool-id evidence; the saved source remains $CODEX_HOME/
                                           agents/*.toml.
  4. [user active] explorer                Custom explorer role for codebase discovery.
  5. [user tools] Edit tools for explorer  Update this native role TOML allowlist from current tools
  6. [built-in active] default             Default agent.
  7. [built-in shadowed] explorer          Use `explorer` for specific codebase questions.
  8. [built-in active] worker              Use for execution and production work.

  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
